00:33:46.980 --> 00:34:10.710
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>First class, LaDonna opened with the piece of education people at Allied seemed to have missed-- how to act in a workplace. She held up the AlliedBarton employee handbook. She explained, Allied has a multimillion dollar contract to protect this airport. That is our job. It is what the airport, the client, wants us to be focused on 100% of the time.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>第一节课，LaDonna从Allied似乎错过的教育开始——如何在工作场所行事。她举起AlliedBarton员工手册。她解释说，Allied有一份价值数百万美元的合同来保护这个机场。那是我们的工作。这是机场，也就是客户，希望我们百分之百专注的事情。

00:34:10.710 --> 00:34:50.700
<v LaDonna  Powell>The client is paying us for a certain quality of work environment. The client is paying us for a certain quality of person working here. For one thing, I would always tell them, this is a sexual harassment-free environment. And I would say to them, you want to read this page-- I can't remember the page at this moment, but I always said, you want to read this page. You want to know your rights. This is a place where you should be able to come to work, not be touched or solicited for sex. You don't want to let people think it's OK to solicit you for sex. This is a place of security. No matter what's happening here, don't adapt to that.
<v LaDonna  Powell>客户为我们支付了一定质量的工作环境费用。客户支付了我们一定素质的人员在这里工作的费用。首先，我总是告诉他们，这是一个没有性骚扰的环境。我会对他们说，你们想读读这一页——我不记得现在是哪一页了，但我总是说，你们想读读这一页。你们要了解自己的权利。这是一个你应该能够来工作，不被骚扰或索要性服务的地方。不要让人们以为索要性服务是可以的。这是一个安全的地方。无论这里发生什么，都不要适应那个环境。

00:34:50.700 --> 00:35:03.530
<v LaDonna  Powell>They should know they're allowed to use the bathroom. They should know they can't walk off the post. Things will happen here. And if it happens, you want to take note. That was always one of my biggest things to them-- you want to write it down. You have a right.
<v LaDonna  Powell>他们应该知道他们被允许使用洗手间。他们应该知道他们不能离开岗位。这里会发生事情。如果发生了，你要记录下来。那一直是我对他们最重要的事情之一——你要把它写下来。你有权利。

00:35:03.530 --> 00:35:06.080
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>You were, like, starting a revolution.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>你就像，在发起一场革命。

