<v LaDonna  Powell>I was trying. And I'm like, listen, open your mind to what I'm saying to you. And then I would just give them morals my mom dropped in my brain, hoping it would stick to them.
<v LaDonna  Powell>我在尝试。我说，听着，敞开胸怀听我说的话。然后我会把妈妈灌输给我的道德准则传授给他们，希望这能留在他们脑子里。

