00:37:54.620 --> 00:38:12.780
<v LaDonna Powell>He told me the story of the supervisor calling him a nigger. And he was like, it's not the first time. And this is in front of the class. This is is a class of-- roughly, this night, it had to be, like, 11 people in the class. And he's telling the story, and everyone knew. So I said to him, who else in here?
<v LaDonna Powell>他告诉了我主管叫他黑鬼的故事。他说，这不是第一次了。而且是在全班面前。这是一个班级——那天晚上，大约有11个人。他在讲这个故事，大家都知道。所以我对他说，这里还有谁？

